Photo Collage & Editor APP, an app to stitch multiple photos into one long picture in order, supports keystrokes, multiple stitching templates, manual adjustments and more.

Subscription:
1、 Users can only go to unlimited use of long picture stitching, keying and other functions after passing a paid subscription;
2, the subscription fee will be deducted from the user's iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase, free trial for three days, can be automatically renewed, the renewal fee of ¥ 298/year;
3、Users can turn off the auto-renewal subscription 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4、Auto-renewal of subscription Apple ID, will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and extend the corresponding validity period;
5、Users manage their subscription services, i.e., after purchase, they can go to their user account to set up a way to turn off automatic subscriptions.

